{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n***WEEKS 3-5***\n<@&702775414220652575> Château de L'Éclipse houses a back room open available only to Knights. Inside is a large round table with 12 lush and blue feathered seats.\n\nThe Château holds the means to provide Sanctuary for all who need it with two other wings of the castle. Decorations and small nods to Machidiel and the rest of the 15 can be found throughout, but prayer is expected to just be for the community temple.\n\nMello sits in a large aquarium with hermit crabs and a fish more fish friends in the round table room along the wall, emitting constant waves of warmth and happiness.\n\nSuits of armor line the hallways as a defense mechanism, all bearing an eclipse on their breastplate.\n\nA circular room stands alone with ornaments and portraits of the 15 and their symbols. A display case stands in each one holding one of the artifacts found that is not currently being used by a member of the Knights","created_at":"2020-08-02T18:41:51.965000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-02T18:42:29.436000Z","id":"739553572668309644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
